# Everything the image must never contain.
#
# The first two entries are the ones that matter: `.env` holds live credentials
# and `data/` holds somebody's research. A container image is copied, pushed to
# a registry and pulled by machines you do not control — neither belongs in one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/

node_modules
client/dist
dist

.git
.gitignore
tests
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Build and editor noise.
.vscode
.idea
*.log
coverage
.DS_Store
